  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ある特定の　ポケモンを進化させる　不思議なヨロイ。呪いの感情が　秘められている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "어느 특정 포켓몬을 진화시키는 이상한 갑옷. 저주의 감정이 담겨 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能讓特定寶可夢進化的神奇鎧甲。秘藏著詛咒的情感。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une armure mystérieuse pouvant faire évoluer un certain Pokémon. Une grande rancune y est enfermée.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese sonderbare Rüstung löst bei einem bestimmten Pokémon die Entwicklung aus. Sie ist von einem verfluchten Willen beseelt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Curiosa armadura que hace evolucionar a una determinada especie de Pokémon. En su interior alberga sentimientos de rencor.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Armatura particolare che fa evolvere determinate specie di Pokémon. Alberga dentro di sé sentimenti infausti.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A peculiar set of armor that can make a certain species of Pokémon evolve. Malicious will lurks within it.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ある特定の　ポケモンを進化させる　不思議なヨロイ。呪いの感情が　秘められている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能让某些特定宝可梦进化的神奇铠甲。蕴含着诅咒的感情。",
